    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 339,
        "text": "Hi everyone, thanks for coming to the pool training review. I'm Mark, the data coordinator. Today we'll look at the numbers from last month's sessions and decide what to change. First, let's check attendance. In total, we had 240 visits across all sessions. That's 20 more than the previous month. Good news, but we need to look closer.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "65ff4f6d18c8151a9a4a96750fe86b3dbb7f82668d9650354791585c252e4a97",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 343,
        "sourceEnd": 420,
        "text": "Can I ask about the morning sessions? I thought they were quieter than usual.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "484d31dd4311a16de4f38aeb5c945e3fc1dc5c1606077b6b4a67bacc2fe7499d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 424,
        "sourceEnd": 648,
        "text": "Yes, you're right. The morning sessions had 80 visits, which is 30 fewer than the evening sessions. The evening sessions were the busiest with 110 visits. The afternoon sessions had 50 visits, so they were the least popular.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "aba940137ae0abd3de722b365e617d667caf1d13037a131541d001666bb6d473",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 652,
        "sourceEnd": 747,
        "text": "So the evening is clearly the most popular. But what about the instructors? Did we have enough?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "fb1f278daf31ddd73cebc1888f478508d0b9b5849eaf5e8e1ab6a88282a03206",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 751,
        "sourceEnd": 985,
        "text": "We had three instructors: Lisa, Tom, and me. Lisa taught 12 sessions, Tom taught 10, and I taught 8. So Lisa taught the most sessions. But here's a correction: last time I said Tom taught 12, but that was wrong. He actually taught 10.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "a8288d16337fec7603e2983d2cbd62e56bb23635f8f367f1163aafd664569bac",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 989,
        "sourceEnd": 1101,
        "text": "Okay, so Lisa taught the most. What about feedback scores? I remember some comments about the water temperature.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "9c90ff7160abdffc98a7d63ec99a0aa54cec13a97cec1c0b893f430e233b044a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1105,
        "sourceEnd": 1366,
        "text": "Yes, the average satisfaction score was 4.2 out of 5. That's slightly higher than last month's 4.0. But the comments about water temperature were mostly negative. 15 people mentioned it was too cold, and only 5 said it was fine. So we should adjust the heating.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "5c89c711c76abc8ebf35d14261ec1cb305460d2f021ed8939079e22bc7a45a7d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1370,
        "sourceEnd": 1430,
        "text": "And what about the new swimmers? Did we have many beginners?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "6f35d600176176642113b4a996f0b3221f988ce6a0f93c7e270a14bff86ff41f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1434,
        "sourceEnd": 1621,
        "text": "We had 30 beginners, which is 10 more than last month. The intermediate group had 45, and the advanced group had 25. So beginners are growing, but intermediate is still the largest group.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "34cf230fe2ce6d17840a5066e0cb124f8c3565c7deee46c9b25e314d5d091407",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1625,
        "sourceEnd": 1719,
        "text": "That makes sense. Now, about the schedule for next month. Should we add more evening sessions?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "0f7ca613e9be957665140956180cf7de6e91f5fe5ac5bfad3299cb2353b82306",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1723,
        "sourceEnd": 1940,
        "text": "Possibly, but we need to consider instructor availability. Lisa is on holiday for two weeks, so she can't teach as many. Tom can cover some evenings, but he prefers mornings. So we might need to hire a new instructor.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "326055b94b9d23d3bf1a45bacd47c204c2beef3686c840e1edcff0e91ea704e0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1944,
        "sourceEnd": 2013,
        "text": "Okay. And the pool will be closed for maintenance on the 15th, right?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "990cea5f286077f8430ebb2926a63991eb98b5a50d5a5f0da7386c75d5bdb4f6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 2017,
        "sourceEnd": 2090,
        "text": "Yes, that's correct. So we need to plan around that. Any other questions?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "05be6a04a750edb3d2dc949da0fc2d81d8b38b1434296ac4961aa8def918f818",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
